.SS "enum \fBstumpless_error_id\fP"

.PP
An (enum) identifier of the types of errors that might be encountered\&. Note that the same error may be encountered in different contexts with a different ultimate cause\&. To completely diagnose a problem, you will need to look at more than just the error id\&.
.PP
See \fBSTUMPLESS_FOREACH_ERROR()\fP and \fBSTUMPLESS_GENERATE_ENUM()\fP for how this enumeration is generated\&. 
.PP
